{
  "name": "Acme - Remover documento",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "formTitle": "Acme - Remover documento",
        "formDescription": "Informe a senha e o nome do arquivo. Deixe o arquivo vazio para limpar a base inteira.",
        "formFields": {
          "values": [
            {
              "fieldLabel": "Senha do upload",
              "fieldName": "password",
              "fieldType": "password",
              "required": true
            },
            {
              "fieldLabel": "Arquivo a remover",
              "fieldName": "arquivo",
              "fieldType": "text",
              "required": false,
              "placeholder": "ex.: ferias.md (vazio = limpar tudo)"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {
          "path": "acme-remove-docs"
        }
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.formTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ],
      "name": "Formulário de remoção"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "senha",
              "name": "senha",
              "value": "={{ $json[\"Senha do upload\"] || $json.password }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "arquivo",
              "name": "arquivo",
              "value": "={{ ($json['Arquivo a remover'] || '').trim() }}",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        220,
        0
      ],
      "name": "Preparar dados"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "action": "hash",
        "type": "SHA256",
        "value": "={{ $json.senha }}",
        "dataPropertyName": "passwordHash",
        "encoding": "hex"
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.crypto",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        440,
        0
      ],
      "name": "Calcular hash da senha"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "strict",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "password-hash",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.passwordHash }}",
              "rightValue": "f0ac2375c823ca62208820d93163bb1b173bef60b5fc3c71db7b9f442b46e60f",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "equals"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        660,
        0
      ],
      "name": "Senha correta?"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "strict",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "has-file",
              "leftValue": "={{ $('Preparar dados').first().json.arquivo }}",
              "rightValue": "",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "notEmpty",
                "singleValue": true
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        880,
        0
      ],
      "name": "Remover um arquivo?"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "delete",
        "tableId": "acme_documents_vec",
        "filterType": "string",
        "filterString": "=metadata->>source=eq.{{ $('Preparar dados').first().json.arquivo }}"
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.supabase",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1100,
        -140
      ],
      "name": "Remover arquivo"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "delete",
        "tableId": "acme_documents_vec",
        "filterType": "string",
        "filterString": "=id=gte.0"
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.supabase",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1100,
        140
      ],
      "name": "Limpar base inteira"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.noOp",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        880,
        220
      ],
      "name": "Senha inválida - encerrar"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## O que este fluxo faz\nRemove UM documento da base pelo nome do arquivo.\nSe o campo de arquivo ficar vazio, limpa a base vetorial inteira para comecar uma demo do zero.",
        "height": 140,
        "width": 300
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -260,
        -240
      ],
      "name": "Nota 1"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Mesma senha do upload\nA senha e conferida por SHA-256 antes de qualquer delete.\nSem a senha correta o fluxo termina sem tocar no banco.",
        "height": 150,
        "width": 300
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        180,
        -240
      ],
      "name": "Nota 2"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Delete por fonte\n`metadata->>source = nome do arquivo` remove so os trechos daquele documento;\nos demais continuam na base.",
        "height": 150,
        "width": 320
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        800,
        -240
      ],
      "name": "Nota 3"
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Formulário de remoção": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Preparar dados",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Preparar dados": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Calcular hash da senha",
